issues.problem:
A default-on `git commit` in your repository:
- sweeps whatever you have staged into telelean's commit;
- runs your pre-commit and commit-msg hooks;
- fails without user.name/email;
- pollutes branch history.
With the §1 layout, mental_model/ sits inside the telelean source repository. Once that repository is initialised, every Accept would commit into the extension's development history, including any staged work by your coding agent.
